@@ -93,3 +93,21 @@ cost ~6x and chose a long detour, so the default is 1. Test: `goal_cost_scoring_
 Corner simulation (corner_scenarios): all scenarios arrive at 0.08/0.10/0.125/0.15 m; at 0.10 m
